{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经Bifrost疑似Kerberos攻击。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Potential Kerberos Attack via Bifrost。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经Bifrost疑似Kerberos攻击","references":["https://github.com/its-a-feature/bifrost"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"16904215-2c95-4ac8-bf5c-12354e047192","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and\n process.args like~ \"-action\" and\n (\n  process.args like~ (\"-kerberoast\", \"askhash\", \"asktgs\", \"asktgt\", \"s4u\") or\n  (process.args like~ \"-ticket\" and process.args like~ \"ptt\") or\n  (process.args like~ \"dump\" and process.args in~ (\"tickets\", \"keytab\"))\n )\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经Bifrost疑似Kerberos攻击\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1550","name":"Use Alternate Authentication Material","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1550.002","name":"Pass the Hash","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/002/"},{"id":"T1550.003","name":"Pass the Ticket","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1552.001","name":"Credentials In Files","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/001/"}]},{"id":"T1558","name":"Steal or Forge Kerberos Tickets","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1558.003","name":"Kerberoasting","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/003/"},{"id":"T1558.005","name":"Ccache Files","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1550","name":"Use Alternate Authentication Material","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1550.002","name":"Pass the Hash","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/002/"},{"id":"T1550.003","name":"Pass the Ticket","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":113,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
